ore fluid and our life easier  for many here now being a fully  integrated member of the European Union  with open borders and a common currency  is a good thing despite some emotional  attachments and early problems with  switching currencies it seems in the  long run many croatians prefer  these open roads Stephanie Decker Al  Jazeera on the Croatia Slovenia border
 

